# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/post/fixtures/inbox
# Replies from the cached inbox: a saved draft, a reply the gateway
# rejected, and a new reply queued while the gateway is out of reach.
wait-for Tea notes
# A letter with a draft offers to continue it, with the draft in the field.
tap Tea notes
wait-for First flush, two minutes, no milk.
expect Continue your reply
tap Continue your reply
wait-for Sounds good, I will try it
expect Send letter
clean
shot post-compose-draft
# Each key saves the draft, so leaving and coming back keeps the words.
tap space
type soon
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Tea notes
tap Tea notes
wait-for Continue your reply
tap Continue your reply
wait-for Sounds good, I will try it soon
# Sending queues the reply. With no token it stays queued and says why.
tap Send letter
wait-for Your reply: Queued for the next connection.
wait-for No Hermes account is on this reader yet
expect Write a reply
clean
shot post-reply-queued
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for 1 reply waiting to be sent.
clean
shot post-inbox-queued
# A rejected reply says so on its letter and opens for editing.
tap Ghost letter
wait-for Your reply: Rejected by the gateway.
expect Edit your reply
clean
shot post-rejected
tap Edit your reply
wait-for Thanks for this one
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Tea notes
# The queue and the rejected reply survive a restart.
restart
wait-for 1 reply waiting to be sent.
tap Ghost letter
wait-for Your reply: Rejected by the gateway.
tap-id 4294967295
tap Tea notes
wait-for Your reply: Queued for the next connection.
tap-id 4294967295
# A reply with nothing in it is refused for being empty, not for length.
tap Garden plan
wait-for Write a reply
tap Write a reply
wait-for Send letter
tap Send letter
wait-for Write a reply
clean
shot post-empty-reply
expect-missing at most 32,000 characters
expect This reply is empty.
